Place libsodium.js (sumo build) here before deploying.

Download: https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium.js/releases
File: sodium.js from the "sumo" package (includes crypto_box_seal).

Or install via npm and copy:
  npm install libsodium-wrappers-sumo
  cp node_modules/libsodium-wrappers-sumo/dist/modules/libsodium-wrappers-sumo.js ./libsodium.js

The file is ~2MB and not committed to the repo.
